cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Lit Orbit in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Lit Orbit"
abstract: >-
  An orbit view of a literature batch: evidence tiers as rings, a column of
  your choice as wedges, and every study drawn bolder the more of your course
  it shares. A batch set up in it can be published as a website
  of its own.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Liu
    given-names: Jingwen
repository-code: "https://github.com/shoujyo/lit-orbit"
license: MIT
